# Keep complete integration previews out of Python source distributions.
prune preview-build
prune checks
prune adapters
prune tools
prune tests/adapter
include API.md
include NOTICE.md
include LICENSE
include README.md
include SPOTIFY.md
prune tests/release
recursive-include tests/library *.py *.ini *.json *.txt *.md
include POSITION-RESTORE.md
include DIAGNOSTICS.md
include NATIVE-MODES.md
include EXACT-TRACK-RETURN.md
